Our business currently depends significantly on research and development spending by academic institutions, a reduction in which could limit
demand for our products and adversely affect our business and operating results.
In the year ended December 31, 2019, approximately 70% of our direct sales revenue came from sales to academic institutions. Much of their funding
was, in turn, provided by various state, federal and international
